@startuml sd_us107
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US107 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AirportController" as AirportController
participant "ViewAirportDetailsUseCase" as ViewAirportDetailsUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== GET /api/airports/{iataCode} ==
Actor -> EAR : GET /api/airports/{iataCode}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> AirportController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AirportController -> ViewAirportDetailsUseCase : execute(...)
ViewAirportDetailsUseCase -> DBAR : read airports
note right of DBAR : catalog: complete on every replica
DBAR --> ViewAirportDetailsUseCase : data
ViewAirportDetailsUseCase --> AirportController : result
AirportController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id)
@enduml
